# Voice text

- `Voice:` line hamesha Devanagari Hindi mein likho. Yahi text awaaz banega.
- Overlay, title, caption aur baaki script Roman Hinglish mein raho.
- Tech words voice mein Devanagari: गिट, गिटहब, कमिट, पुश. Roman spelling voice line mein mat chhodo.
- Vowel mat kheench. Ek line ek saans.
